तेजोमयं विश्वमनन्तमाद्यं
यन्मे त्वदन्येन न दृष्टपूर्वम् ॥ ४७ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3395,\"bb\":2989,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/47/b2989/\",\"body_value\":\"śrī-bhagavān uvāca
